# Cross-runtime parity layer for the R8 Supremacy Pack. The Merkle
# algorithm hashes hex-string concatenations only, so both runtimes
# produce byte-identical roots, proofs, and audit reports. The
# canonical JSON substrate reuses the R7.1 JS-emulation layer.
